    <h1 class="title">Cognitive Behavioral Therapy among Ghana's Rural Poor Is Effective Regardless of Baseline Mental Distress</h1>
    <ul class="attribution">
            <li class='author' style='margin-bottom:0.5em; '>
         Nathan Barker    </li>
    <li class='author' style='margin-bottom:0.5em; '>
